          "message": {
            "text": "The repository-wide rule covers every maintained prose surface so future changes do not reintroduce mixed regional spelling. The exception is deliberately narrow: externally defined text and identifiers must remain exact to preserve compatibility and faithful quotations.",
            "markdown": "The repository-wide rule covers every maintained prose surface so future changes do not reintroduce mixed regional spelling. The exception is deliberately narrow: externally defined text and identifiers must remain exact to preserve compatibility and faithful quotations."
          },
